# UzPainter's module search path for the embedded CPython 3.13 (installed beside python313.dll;
# docs/architecture/13-engine-integration.md section 5). A ._pth file next to python313.dll
# replaces the whole sys.path calculation and puts the interpreter in isolated mode: PYTHONPATH,
# PYTHONHOME, the user site-packages, the registry and any installed Python are ignored. Paths
# are relative to this file's folder.
#
# The standard library of the embeddable package.
python313.zip
# The embeddable package's extension modules (*.pyd) beside python313.dll.
.
# The pinned wheels (thirdparty/python-wheels/), unpacked by `zig build painter`.
Lib\site-packages
# The substance_painter facade, substance_painter_plugins and uzpainter_facade (python/,
# python/FACADE.md), installed by `zig build painter` and `zig build pyapi-tests`.
python
# Run site.main(): processes the .pth files of Lib\site-packages (pywin32.pth); the user
# site-packages stays disabled in isolated mode.
import site
